  "content": "```html\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Случайные части тела врагов погибают!</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_f8f6ddfd-7371-4b02-a5f9-a2c84be9b80d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"177\"></em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Все сущие Нижнего мира и Краля теперь могут кровь! И скелеты тоже!</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_3f4bacf5-b885-4f1b-9679-9c57ff8a6a0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_4f9b9591-3543-417b-a081-9bcda9162114.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_07017f84-b1e7-43f8-a040-be81f2c58978.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_391b5329-e4c0-4d69-b8b0-06d43ffe493e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_fe331c90-6866-4b83-bf36-9e196ea4c1a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_2708d754-f7ca-450b-9b75-e17b744a5fac.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></strong><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_7c13dfe6-9f96-4971-a631-f83f9d2770de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_9bbf9ab9-71b8-477d-af53-72e6235b6860.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></strong><img style=\"font-weight:400